commit d3aed5ab45768155eb84ff5edb4006dc6735ad17
Author: FAYEZ2030 <semester-2030@outlook.com>
Date:   Wed Nov 18 14:47:50 2026 +0300

    fix(discover): stop blocking prefix seed; defer full fill until after open
    
    1714 awaited a 1MiB ensurePlayablePrefix inside resolvePlaySource and hid ~20s behind FIRST_BYTE_MS. Return the proxy immediately with a non-blocking kick, prioritize before prefix prefetch, and keep full ensureLocal until after first visible progress. Seek nudge now raises the progress floor so seek landing alone cannot count as firstFrame.
    
    Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>

